      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23047/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, shortening, baking powder, and salt in a large bowl; stir in water until dough is smooth. Cover and set aside for 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XcBjo8UATXMaWzVdFKroDiP07Yo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-23047-real-sopapillas-DDMFS-Step-2-3b57e42d91f04058970727d8a7b41697.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23047/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep fryer to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Roll dough out on a floured board until ⅛- to ¼-inch thick.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9lehbgn25yfPUbVt7YqMQaYWl7A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-23047-real-sopapillas-DDMFS-Step-2-1-a6c82a74c91d45c3bb3887638046449f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23047/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut into 3-inch squares.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QxtX2RDtgDzJ3UKmTlmOU0CAAe4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-23047-real-sopapillas-DDMFS-Step-3-dd2b2213fd464deab3ddcff172ebd901.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23047/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry dough squares in the preheated oil until golden brown on both sides.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
